  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Morning Light**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **Clinch Mountain Backstep**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Beauty Of My Reams**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **June Apple**: back after 70 archived shows (698 days); rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Gotta Jibboo**: back after 142 archived shows (983 days); rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **Nellie Kane**: back after 53 archived shows (635 days); rare: 12 archived performances [3]\n- **If Your Hair's Too Long (There's Sin In Your Heart)**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: West Dakota Rose [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2021-08-03.ChamplainValleyMusicExpoEssexVT** (recommended): audience recording; 24 songs; 133 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer attended in person; it was their first live Billy Strings show, and they called the evening perfect [2]\n- Reviewer was surprised by the band's space jams during the show [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2021-08-03.ChamplainValleyMusicExpoEssexVT**: taped by JT/NY; transferred by JT/NY; source: Aud > Nak 700's W CP701's > GAKable's > Sound Devices 722 @ 24/96 [1]. Also: Audience recording made with Nak 700 mics and CP701 capsules, going through GAKable's into a Sound Devices 722 at 24/96; Transferred via Sound Forge Pro 12.0 for tracking and editing, then converted to FLAC with Traders Little Helper; uploaded by JT/NY [1]",
